      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/replay/corridor.tsx",
      "content": "`tapped` is cleared only when a focus event occurs, but a touch/pen pointerdown does not always cause one. For example, tapping an already-focused session sets this flag without firing another focus event; pressing Tab then suppresses the next session's genuine keyboard focus. A canceled gesture can leave the same stale flag. Scope suppression to the tap's focus transition and clear it when switching to keyboard navigation. Add a regression test that taps an already-focused button and then tabs to another; the current test always supplies a focus event immediately after pointerdown, so it misses this case.",
